  "rationales": [
    "mjug thogs=just subsequent preserves the immediate temporal relation. Master glossary subsequent and reference immediately subsequent plus actual C05:333/ILL:590/591 explain the modifier; no artificial mjug/thogs child split.",
    "sbyor ba/sbyor=undertakings/undertaking distinguish plural initial stage from singular stage in the list; exact complete-row occurrences are recorded.",
    "med is the negative existential lexical item paired with the unique no; explicit English order places it before all three poisons while the source order places it after them.",
    "C16:852 matches this verse, and C16:858 matches the explanation, but these digital matches are not treated as independent publication witnesses."
  ],
  "omissions": [
    "Second rtsa is omitted because 'these three' suppresses the root noun; these is not treated as a lexical translation of rtsa.",
    "Final skyes is omitted: the English last line elides come, and no earlier come is reused.",
    "yi and the temporal las after mjug thogs are omitted because the relation is distributed through 'just subsequent to them'; no isolated from is stolen from another line.",
    "they and these are English supplies; de aligns only to them. Articles remain unwrapped, and sogs claims only rest (not a supplied following noun).",
    "No separate semantic member within Coveting, ignorance, root, or undertakings: those are whole established terms, not arbitrary English substrings."
  ],
